      <main>
        <h2>Returns, Refunds & Payment Methods</h2>

        <p>
          At Bookmore, we want every shopping experience to be simple, secure, and enjoyable. Below you'll find
          information about our return policy, refund process, and accepted payment methods.
        </p>

        <h2>Returns & Refunds</h2>

        <p>
          <strong>Can I Return a Book?</strong>
          Yes. Most books may be returned within 30 days of delivery, provided they are: <br>

          In their original condition <br>
          Unused and undamaged <br>
          Returned with any included packaging <br>

          Unfortunately, we cannot accept returns for items that show signs of excessive use or damage caused after
          delivery. <br>

          Damaged or Incorrect Items <br>

          If you receive a damaged, defective, or incorrect item, please contact us within 7 days of receiving your
          order. <br>

          Our customer support team will arrange a replacement or issue a full refund at no additional cost.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>How to Return an Item</strong>
          Returning an item is easy: <br>

          Contact our Customer Support team. <br>
          Provide your order number and reason for the return. <br>
          Carefully package the item. <br>
          Send it using the return instructions provided by our team. <br>

          Once we receive and inspect the returned item, we'll notify you about the status of your refund.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>Refunds</strong>
          Approved refunds are processed using the original payment method. <br>

          Please allow 5–10 business days for the refund to appear in your account, depending on your bank or payment
          provider. <br>

          Shipping charges are non-refundable unless the return is due to our error or a damaged product.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>Payment Methods</strong>
          Bookmore offers secure and convenient payment options. <br>

          We currently accept: <br>

          💳 Visa <br>
          💳 Mastercard <br>
          💳 Maestro <br>

          All payments are processed through secure, encrypted payment gateways to protect your personal and financial
          information.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>Payment Security</strong>
          Your security is our priority. <br>

          We use industry-standard encryption to ensure that all transactions are processed safely. <br>

          Bookmore never stores your full credit or debit card details on our servers.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>When Will I Be Charged?</strong>
          Payment is authorised and processed when you complete your order. <br>

          Once payment has been successfully received, we'll begin preparing your order for dispatch.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>Having Payment Issues?</strong>
          If your payment is declined: <br>

          Check that your card details are correct. <br>
          Ensure your card has sufficient available funds. <br>
          Contact your bank if the issue persists. <br>
          Try an alternative payment method.
        </p>

        <p>
          If you have any questions about returns, refunds, or payments, please <a href="/contacts">contact us</a>.
        </p>

      </main>
      </div>

